Using ChatGPT to write a Rainbow poem and revise it myself.

The Rainbow’s Lament

Red’s too bold, it steals the show,  
Orange is just… diet yellow.  
Yellow’s bright, but makes me sneeze,  
Green just smells like broccoli trees.  
Blue is chill, but far too sad,  
Indigo’s shy, and purple’s mad.  

Seven colors, all in a fight—  
Why can’t rainbows just be white.
